\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec:conclusion}

We present factorial-controlled analysis of VLA representations, revealing token-level specialization, front-loaded instruction routing, and non-monotonic refinement at the readout token.
The framework generalizes to any decoder-only VLA with a frozen vision encoder, enabling cross-architecture comparison; multi-model validation and closed-loop evaluation are natural next steps.
Code and representations will be released upon acceptance.

\paragraph{Use of Generative AI.}
Generative AI tools (Claude, GPT-4) assisted with code implementation and manuscript editing; all scientific content was produced by the authors.

